From 520f19a8fc68c6448e4772f3a8d7dc6ddc85e954 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zimbermanne <zimbermanne@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 07:57:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Apply liquid-glass distortion effect to sidebar and cards

Uses the reference liquid-glass-distortion-card-in-css-and-svg CSS/SVG
verbatim rather than a renamed variant:

- LiquidGlassFilter.jsx: the feDisplacementMap-based SVG filter, id
  kept as glass-filter-_r_b_, mounted once at the true app root above
  the router so public routes (Landing, Login, ...) get it too.
- design-tokens.css: --glass-frost, --glass-saturation, --filter-id
  tokens (same names/defaults as the reference snippet).
- globals.css: .card, .home-kpi-card and .sidebar now use the
  reference's exact background/backdrop-filter/box-shadow triple
  (hsl(...frost), var(--filter-id) saturate(...), the lab()-based
  inset shadow stack) instead of the plain-blur/@supports fallback
  from the previous version.
---
 frontend/src/App.jsx                          |   2 +
 frontend/src/components/LiquidGlassFilter.jsx | 129 ++++++------------
 frontend/src/styles/design-tokens.css         |   8 ++
 frontend/src/styles/globals.css               |  54 ++++++--
 4 files changed, 94 insertions(+), 99 deletions(-)

diff --git a/frontend/src/App.jsx b/frontend/src/App.jsx
index 5e86fce..95cbba5 100644
--- a/frontend/src/App.jsx
+++ b/frontend/src/App.jsx
